{"root":"kualitas","ipa":"/kua.li.tas/","core":"指事物的性质、品质、质量或等级，通常用于评价产品、服务或人的素质。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kua.li.tas/","zh":"质量，品质","phrases":[{"t":"kualitas tinggi","zh":"高质量"},{"t":"menjaga kualitas","zh":"保持质量"},{"t":"standar kualitas","zh":"质量标准"}],"examples":[{"t":"Produk ini memiliki kualitas yang sangat baik.","zh":"这个产品质量非常好。"},{"t":"Kita harus mengutamakan kualitas daripada kuantitas.","zh":"我们应该重质不重量。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kualitas","ipa":"/kua.li.tas/","zh":"质量，品质","phrase":{"t":"kontrol kualitas","zh":"质量控制"},"example":{"t":"Kualitas hidupnya meningkat.","zh":"他的生活质量提高了。"}},{"w":"berkualitas","ipa":"/bər.kua.li.tas/","zh":"有质量的，优质的","phrase":{"t":"pendidikan berkualitas","zh":"优质教育"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah pekerja yang sangat berkualitas.","zh":"他是一位非常有素质的员工。"}},{"w":"mengkualitaskan","ipa":"/məŋ.kua.li.tas.kan/","zh":"使具有某种质量，提升质量","phrase":{"t":"mengkualitaskan produk","zh":"提升产品质量"},"example":{"t":"Perusahaan berupaya mengkualitaskan layanan mereka.","zh":"公司致力于提升他们的服务质量。"}}],"derSlugs":["kualitas","berkualitas","mengkualitaskan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:51:35.456Z","src":"base"}